                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Since 1965, Medicare and Medicaid have provided high-quality affordable healthcare for millions of Americans, including hundreds of thousands of South Texans. However, the Trump Administration and Republicans have passed the One Big, Ugly Bill to strip 17 million Americans of their healthcare coverage, including 1.6 million Texans just to satisfy the desires of the ultra-rich.",
