                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Let's call the Big, Ugly Bill what it is\u2014a cold and calculated attempt to strip South Texans of their hard earned benefits, healthcare, and our children access to nutritious meals, sometimes the only food they receive a day.",
