                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Since the passage of the \u201cBig, Ugly Bill\u201d, health care costs continue to rise as Americans struggle to make ends meet. We need Republicans to stop their attacks on\u00a0health\u00a0care, extend these critical health insurance tax credits, and reverse their disastrous Medicaid cuts.",
