                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am proud to join my Democratic colleagues in co-sponsoring the Protecting Healthcare and Lowering Costs Act of 2025. Through this bill, we would reverse the drastic health care cuts Republicans passed in the \u201cBig, Ugly Bill\u201d and permanently extend the Affordable Care Act\u2019s (ACA) enhanced premium tax credits.",
