                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Without congressional action to extend these tax credits, South Texans who obtain health care through the ACA will be forced to pay almost 200% more in insurance costs.\n\nIts time for Republicans to right their wrongs, and do right by the American people.",
                "text_lang": "en",
