                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am committed to renewing the tax credits that make healthcare more affordable for our working families, seniors and veterans. If Congress doesn\u2019t act now, monthly insurance costs will skyrocket up to $420 monthly for more than 100,000 South Texans. https://t.co/4MWSt63nK1",
