                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I sat down with KRIS 6 last week to set the record straight about the Big Ugly Bill.\n\nWe need policies that help working families, seniors, and veterans succeed. Slashing Medicare, limiting meals for our children and seniors, and raising healthcare costs are not it. https://t.co/mX3SwSGzl9",
