                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Once again, extreme Washington Republicans are trying to mislead and distract us. So let me set the record straight: undocumented immigrants are not eligible for health insurance tax credits or Medicaid. I do not support changing the law to do that. What I do support is assuring hardworking South Texans don't see their premiums rise astronomically and risk losing access to the care they need because the cost of everything is through the roof.\nhttps://t.co/kcBeQzpYsC",
