                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Are you worried about losing coverage if the Affordable Care Act's (ACA) tax credits expire? Let us know below:\n\nhttps://t.co/QSs2V6nwmG https://t.co/OKKPCyE54z",
