                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I'm a supporter of financial innovation, but we need to make sure that any deposit insurance reforms do not burden small banks and price out working South Texans, many of whom are already facing higher health care costs from Republican policies.\n\nThat's why I questioned witnesses in the @USHouseFSC to ensure safeguards put in place do not increase costs for working American families and the underbanked.\n\nFamilies need reliable financial services, not to be forced into seeking out high-cost alternatives.",
